Package: robjc
Title: Objective-C Inspired OOP Framework for R Using R6
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Satoshi", "Yano", , "yanosatoshi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a lightweight object-oriented programming framework in R,
    inspired by Objective-C, using R6 classes. Includes scalar wrappers, 
    dictionary and set structures, protocol simulation, and safe copying.
